{"detail": {"templateUuid": "ae9ed9a27b2b4785947ae158694fcc8c", "projectUuid": "27410d49111140749b76e2e3e49427b7", "name": "《苔》_香水TVC", "description": "本项目是一次关于“嗅觉视觉化”的探索。\n在“MOSS”的视觉构建中，我试图打破传统香水广告中常见的过度修饰与高光堆砌。核心创意在于“回归原生”通过模拟阴天漫反射的柔和光感，还原苔藓、黑石与皮肤最真实的哑光肌理。\n人物不再是自然的闯入者，而是与森林共生的有机体。通过对旋焦镜头的模拟和微观视角的介入，我构建了一个潮湿、静谧且具有呼吸感的视觉场域，旨在传达一种“不油腻的清冷感”和东方的禅意哲学。", "coverUrl": "/assets/877ba29c1bfc1183.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/4e14a402f99445bbb2f48f74396e78ed/be4c2fdc19e5853f0c29ee884992909421b9ac65.mp4", "snapshotId": 1293, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3968535, "ownerUuid": "4e14a402f99445bbb2f48f74396e78ed", "avatar": "/assets/12b7079499a0b051.webp", "nickname": "KUNC", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 525, "tags": [{"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年03月23日 23:52", "updateAt": "2026年04月16日 02:22", "publishAt": "2026年03月25日 23:22", "playCount": 517, "viewCreationProcessCount": 258, "copyCanvasCount": 55, "shareCount": 20, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/ae9ed9a27b2b4785947ae158694fcc8c.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 213, "edges": 154}}, "recommendList": []}